### OMS4 queue email notification

Enqueues an email.send command in RabbitMQ. The OMS4 email worker performs SMTP delivery asynchronously with retry and DLQ handling, then publishes notification.email_status events to Kafka.

### Request JSON Schema
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "to",
    "subject",
    "body"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "to": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "email"
    },
    "subject": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "body": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    }
  }
}
```

